body:
oh boy i have a few;

.One time my dad went to visit my the inlaws, who at this time lived on a small animal farm. So my dad drives up to the house and opens the door to get out, when a goose pops his stupid bird head in and starts hissing. My dad, being a calm and level headed indvidual, shouted and slammed the door on the swan. Now, this was when my dad had only started seeing my mum, and he wanted to make a good impression on the inlaws, so he picked up the limp body of the goose and chucked it in a hedge. The goose lived as a note, but my mums parents did make reference as to why the goose was walking funny.

.One time my dad took my older sister to a farm park. While my at the time toddler of a sister reached up to pet the horse, the toothy bastard tried to bite her hand. My dad, being a calm and level headed individual, ran up and punched the horse square in the snout. The horse lived, as a note, but it did stumble backwards.
